{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06588","headline":"秦中初霁献给事二首 二 · 储光羲","name":"秦中初霁献给事二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国久爲思，西都尝作宾。\n云开天地色，日照山河春。\n善听在知己，扬光唯达人。\n妙年弄柔翰，弱冠偶良晨。\n擢第文昌阁，还家沧海滨。\n寸心何所望，东掖有贤臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}